      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|              THE KRAFT MILL — FULL SYSTEM VIEW                   |\n|                                                                  |\n|  WOOD      CHIP BIN   DIGESTER    BLOW      BROWN STOCK          |\n|  YARD  →  (screened) → (cooking) → TANK  →  WASHING →            |\n|                           |                                      |\n|                    BLACK LIQUOR           SCREENING              |\n|                           |                   |                  |\n|                    EVAPORATION         BLEACH PLANT              |\n|                           |                   |                  |\n|                    RECOVERY BOILER     BLEACHED PULP             |\n|                           |                   |                  |\n|                    CAUSTICIZING       TO PAPER MACHINE           |\n|                           |          or DRYING MACHINE           |\n|                    WHITE LIQUOR                                  |\n|                    (recycled)                                    |\n|                                                                  |\n|  CHEMICAL LOOP: NaOH + Na2S → Black liquor → Recovery → White L. |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
